@startuml GitEasyArchitectureOverview
title GitEasy - Architecture Overview (v1.5.5)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "User / PowerShell session" as User

package "GitEasy module" {
  component "Public command surface\n21 commands" <<command>> as Public
  component "Git engine\nInvoke-GEGit" <<engine>> as Engine
  component "Logging\nsession + 30-day prune" <<helper>> as Log
  component "Query helpers\nGet-GE* repo facts" <<helper>> as Query
  component "Safety helpers\nAssert-GESafeSave, URL input guards,\nURL + log-line output sanitisers" <<helper>> as Safety
}

component "git executable" <<boundary>> as Git
component ".git repository" <<store>> as Repo
component "Diagnostic log files" <<store>> as Logs
component "Network remote\nGitHub / GitLab" <<boundary>> as Remote
component "Credential stores\nGCM / Windows Vault / SSH / SecretManagement" <<store>> as Creds

User --> Public : runs a command
Public --> Safety : mutating commands gate first
Public --> Log : open / close session
Public --> Query : resolve repo facts
Public --> Engine : every git call routes here
Query --> Engine
Safety --> Engine
Engine --> Git : spawns
Git --> Repo : read / write
Git --> Remote : push / fetch
Log --> Logs : append / prune
Public --> Creds : auth commands only

note bottom of Engine
  Single point of contact with git.
  No other component shells out to git.
end note
@enduml
